  "releaseNotes": "First 1.0 preview: the full storage kernel (stores, databases, boxes, batches, snapshots, scans, durability modes, observability, self-describing databases, replication with handover, backup and restore). The public API may still change before 1.0. Tested on Windows; the first Linux run of the suite is pending. See CHANGELOG.md in the repository.",
